# Weight profile nemotron-bolt-exl3-2.0: NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Bolt 74B-A9B in our EXL3 pack (ENG-337): routed experts
# at 2 bits, the Mamba2, attention, latent and shared-expert projections at 4, head 6 (exllamav3 1.6.2 with the
# Puzzle/Bolt patch, mul1 codebook; 23.48 GB, the RADIO tower kept in BF16 and not loaded), converted from
# nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-74B-A9B-BF16 at revision bca0a8cb. The pack is in a public Hugging Face
# repository. Measured 2026-10-15 against BF16 (8 wikitext rows x 1,024): KL 0.170, top-1 84.1 %
# (NVIDIA's IQ2 GGUF 0.259 / 79.6 %); decode 44.2 tok/s on the rows path (SPD-125; the IQ2 GGUF 27.9). NVIDIA's
# LiLiCorr drafter and the lookup draft, cut by StairCut: 65.8 / 69.3 / 99.0 / 152.8 / 256.0 tok/s on prose / chat /
# code / edit / copy asks (512 greedy, thinking off), every text the plain run's.
# Switch with ops/use-profile.sh nemotron-bolt-exl3-2.0.
QSE_NH_MODEL=nemotron-3.5-bolt-74b-a9b
QSE_NH_VARIANT=bolt-exl3-2.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=23.48
MAX_LEN=262144
# MemAvailable (GiB) a start needs: the weights (20.22 allocated, measured), the engine and its graphs, the
# allocator, the prefill workspace, three slots' KV, LiLiCorr (1.32 allocated, measured) and the 15 GiB floor
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=50
# the engine's limits. Ceiling: the weights (20.22) + the runtime (an estimate of 4 until measured) + the KV of
# three slots at 262,144 tokens (6) + LiLiCorr (1.32); peak: the ceiling + the prefill workspace (an estimate of 4)
MEM_CEILING_GIB=32
MEM_PEAK_GIB=36
# NVIDIA's LiLiCorr drafter (SPD-123): a draft head of the tree drafter beside the lookup, the IQ2 profile's asset
QSE_NH_HEAD=lilicorr
QSE_NH_LILICORR=${HOME}/models/nemotron-3.5-bolt-lilicorr
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_nemotron.env"
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=0xBakeer/TandemLLM-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-74B-A9B-EXL3-2.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_REVISION=0c59e1c05ce5d0161028d2a8f7392730ba5d79a2
# LiLiCorr: the registry entry's asset (models/nemotron-3.5-bolt-74b-a9b/model.yaml), fetched when missing
QSE_ASSETS="${QSE_NH_LILICORR}/model.safetensors"
